        ('/**\n     * Returns stream of elements in this time-series collection.\n     * Elements are loaded in batch. Batch size is 10.\n     *\n     * @return stream of elements\n     */', '/**\n     * 返回stream of elements in this time-series collection.。\n     * Elements are loaded in batch. Batch size is 10.\n     *\n     * @return stream of elements\n     */'),
