        ('/**\n     * Returns binary stream holder instance by <code>name</code>\n     *\n     * @param name of binary stream\n     * @return BinaryStream object\n     */', '/**\n     * 返回binary stream holder instance by <code>name</code>。\n     *\n     * @param name of binary stream\n     * @return BinaryStream object\n     */'),
