        ('/**\n     * Returns semaphore instance by name.\n     * Supports lease time parameter for each acquired permit.\n     * \n     * @param name name of object\n     * @return PermitExpirableSemaphore object\n     */', '/**\n     * 返回semaphore instance by name.。\n     * Supports lease time parameter for each acquired permit.\n     * \n     * @param name 对象名称\n     * @return PermitExpirableSemaphore object\n     */'),
