        ('/**\n     * Returns vector set instance by name.\n     * <p>\n     * Requires <b>Redis 8.0.0 and higher.</b>\n     *\n     * @param name - name of vector set\n     * @return vector set instance\n     */', '/**\n     * 返回vector set instance by name.。\n     * <p>\n     * Requires <b>Redis 8.0.0 and higher.</b>\n     *\n     * @param name - name of vector set\n     * @return vector set instance\n     */'),
